{"strongs": "H2148", "word": "זְכַרְיָהוּ", "translit": "ze.khar.yah", "root": "זול", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "the well-known prophet", "definition": "זְכַרְיָהוּ , oftener זְכַרְיָה proper name, masculine (Sabean ידֿכראל DHM Epigr. Denkm. 43 ) ᵐ5 Ζαχαρια ( ς ), etc.: — 1. זכריהו , king of Israel, son of Jeroboam II, 2Kgs 15:8 = זכריה 2Kgs 14:29 ; 2Kgs 15:11 . 2. זכריהו , father of Hezekiah's mother 2Chr 29:1 = זכריה 2Kgs 18:2 . 3. זכריהו , contemporary of Isaiah Isa 8:2 . 4. זכריהו , a Reubenite 1Chr 5:7 . 5. זכריה , a Benjamite 1Chr 9:37 ( ᵐ5 Ζαχαρια , A Ζαχχουρ ᵐ5 L Ζεχρει ) = זָ֑כֶר 1Chr 8:31 (see [I. זֶכֶר ]). 6. זכריהו , a Manassite 1Chr 27:21 ( ᵐ5 Ζαβδειου , ᵐ5 L Ζαχαριου ). 7. זכריהו , a son of Jehoshaphat 2Chr 21:2 . 8. זכריה , a captain of Jehosh. 2Chr 17:7 . 9. זכריהו , teacher of Uzziah 2Chr 26:5 . 10. Levites, זכריהו : \\ \\ a. 1Chr 15:18 = זכריה v 1Chr 15:20 , 1Chr 16:5 . \\ \\ b. 1Chr 24:25 . \\ \\ c. 1Chr 26:2 ; 1Chr 26:14 . \\ \\ d. 1Chr 26:11 . \\ \\ e. 2Chr 20:14 . feminine 2Chr 29:13 ( ᵐ5 Ἀζαριας , A Ζαχαριας , so ᵐ5 L ). זכריה : \\ \\ g. 1Chr 9:21 . \\ \\ h. 2Chr 34:12 . \\ \\ i. an Asaphite Neh 12:35 . 11. priests, זכריהו : \\ \\ a. 1Chr 15:24 \\ \\ b. 2Chr 35:8 . זכריה : \\ \\ c. 2Chr 24:20 ( ᵐ5 Ἀζαριαν ; ᵐ5 L Ζαχαριαν ; probably referred to Matt 23:35 , where apparently confusion with f ). \\ \\ d. Neh 11:12 . \\ \\ e. Neh 12:41 . feminine the well-known prophet Zech 1:1 ; Zech 1:7 ; Zech 7:1 ; Zech 7:8 ; Neh 12:16 [compare Aramaic Ezra 5:1 ; Ezra 6:14 ]. 12. returned exiles, זכריה : \\ \\ a. Ezra 8:3 and perhaps v Ezra 8:16 , compare Neh 8:4 . \\ \\ b. Ezra 8:11 ( ᵐ5 Ἀζαριας , A Ζαχαριας , so ᵐ5 L ). \\ \\ c. Ezra 10:26 . \\ \\ d. a man of Judah Neh 11:4 . \\ \\ e. id. Neh 11:5 ( ᵐ5 Θηζεια , א Θηδεια , A Ζαχαριου , so ᵐ5 L ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2363')\">BDB2363</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2148')\">H2148</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2362')\">BDB2362</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2364')\">BDB2364</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>זְכַרְיָהוּ</bdbheb>, oftener <bdbheb>זְכַרְיָה</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (Sabean <bdbheb>ידֿכראל</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>Epigr. Denkm. 43</sup></lookup>) <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ζαχαρια</grk>(<grk>ς</grk>), etc.: — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <bdbheb>זכריהו</bdbheb>, king of Israel, son of Jeroboam II, <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:8\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,8)\">2Kgs 15:8</ref> = <bdbheb>זכריה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 14:29\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(12,14,29)\">2Kgs 14:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,11)\">2Kgs 15:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <bdbheb>זכריהו</bdbheb>, father of Hezekiah's mother <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:1\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,1)\">2Chr 29:1</ref> = <bdbheb>זכריה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:2\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,2)\">2Kgs 18:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <bdbheb>זכריהו</bdbheb>, contemporary of Isaiah <ref ref=\"Isa 8:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,2)\">Isa 8:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <bdbheb>זכריהו</bdbheb>, a Reubenite <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:7\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,7)\">1Chr 5:7</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <bdbheb>זכריה</bdbheb>, a Benjamite <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:37\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,37)\">1Chr 9:37</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ζαχαρια</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('A')\"><reflink>A</reflink></lookup> <grk>Ζαχχουρ</grk> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup> <grk>Ζεχρει</grk>) = <bdbheb>זָ֑כֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:31\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,31)\">1Chr 8:31</ref> (see [I. <bdbheb>זֶכֶר</bdbheb>]). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> <bdbheb>זכריהו</bdbheb>, a Manassite <ref ref=\"1Chr 27:21\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(13,27,21)\">1Chr 27:21</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ζαβδειου</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup> <grk>Ζαχαριου</grk>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>7.</b> <bdbheb>זכריהו</bdbheb>, a son of Jehoshaphat <ref ref=\"2Chr 21:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,21,2)\">2Chr 21:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>8.</b> <bdbheb>זכריה</bdbheb>, a captain of Jehosh. <ref ref=\"2Chr 17:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,17,7)\">2Chr 17:7</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>9.</b> <bdbheb>זכריהו</bdbheb>, teacher of Uzziah <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,5)\">2Chr 26:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>10.</b> Levites, <bdbheb>זכריהו</bdbheb>: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:18\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,18)\">1Chr 15:18</ref> = <bdbheb>זכריה</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Chr 15:20\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,20)\">1Chr 15:20</ref>, <ref ref=\"1Chr 16:5\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(13,16,5)\">1Chr 16:5</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 24:25\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(13,24,25)\">1Chr 24:25</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:2\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,2)\">1Chr 26:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:14\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,14)\">1Chr 26:14</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,11)\">1Chr 26:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 20:14\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(14,20,14)\">2Chr 20:14</ref>. <b>feminine</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,13)\">2Chr 29:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἀζαριας</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('A')\"><reflink>A</reflink></lookup> <grk>Ζαχαριας</grk>, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup>). <bdbheb>זכריה</bdbheb>: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>g.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:21\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,21)\">1Chr 9:21</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>h.</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,12)\">2Chr 34:12</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>i.</b> an Asaphite <ref ref=\"Neh 12:35\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,35)\">Neh 12:35</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>11.</b> priests, <bdbheb>זכריהו</bdbheb>: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:24\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,24)\">1Chr 15:24</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,8)\">2Chr 35:8</ref>. <bdbheb>זכריה</bdbheb>: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:20\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,20)\">2Chr 24:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἀζαριαν</grk>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup> <grk>Ζαχαριαν</grk>; probably referred to <ref ref=\"Matt 23:35\" b=\"40\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(40,23,35)\">Matt 23:35</ref>, where apparently confusion with <b>f</b>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 11:12\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,12)\">Neh 11:12</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 12:41\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,41)\">Neh 12:41</ref>. <b>feminine</b> <highlightword>the well-known prophet</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Zech 1:1\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(38,1,1)\">Zech 1:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 1:7\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(38,1,7)\">Zech 1:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 7:1\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(38,7,1)\">Zech 7:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 7:8\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(38,7,8)\">Zech 7:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:16\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,16)\">Neh 12:16</ref> [compare Aramaic <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:1\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,1)\">Ezra 5:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:14\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,14)\">Ezra 6:14</ref>]. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>12.</b> returned exiles, <bdbheb>זכריה</bdbheb>: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:3\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,3)\">Ezra 8:3</ref> and perhaps v<ref ref=\"Ezra 8:16\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,16)\">Ezra 8:16</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Neh 8:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,4)\">Neh 8:4</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:11\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,11)\">Ezra 8:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἀζαριας</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('A')\"><reflink>A</reflink></lookup> <grk>Ζαχαριας</grk>, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:26\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,26)\">Ezra 10:26</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> a man of Judah <ref ref=\"Neh 11:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,4)\">Neh 11:4</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <highlight>id.</highlight> <ref ref=\"Neh 11:5\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,5)\">Neh 11:5</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Θηζεια</grk>, <bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <grk>Θηδεια</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('A')\"><reflink>A</reflink></lookup> <grk>Ζαχαριου</grk>, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Kgs 15:8", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 15, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "2Kgs 14:29", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 14, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "2Kgs 15:11", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 15, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "2Chr 29:1", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 29, "verse":